{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/capsula_peque\u00f1a.png?t=1745072567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is Love</strong> is a 2D puzzle-platformer that explores the raw emotions behind toxic relationships. Guided by 100 real phrases shared by people who lived through painful experiences, you\u2019ll control a small, tender character trying to break free from a dark antagonist determined to keep you trapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/3.jpg?t=1745072567\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>This is Love</i>, each of the 50 levels is an emotional journey, accompanied by real-life quotes that reflect the psychological and emotional struggles of abusive relationships. You'll explore symbolic, minimalist, and visually striking environments as your antagonist confronts you with manipulative, unsettling messages\u2014constantly trying to reopen old wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal isn't just to move forward, but to understand, heal, and rediscover your inner strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/1.jpg?t=1745072567\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Authentic Narrative:</strong> 100 real quotes from people who experienced toxic relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Symbolic Environments:</strong> Minimalist levels designed to reflect deep emotional states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Introspective Gameplay:</strong> Simple, symbolic puzzles that mirror your emotional progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emotive Soundtrack:</strong> A dark, atmospheric score that adapts to the emotions of each chapter, enhancing your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This is Love</i> is an intimate experience that invites reflection on self-discovery, healing, and the human capacity to rise again after the darkest moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520300?t=1745072567","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520300?t=1745072567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/1e15d70a6b352c072c90d6c74cad7df3e29d1f4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745072567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/1e15d70a6b352c072c90d6c74cad7df3e29d1f4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745072567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/capsula_peque\u00f1a.png?t=1745072567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is Love</strong> is a 2D puzzle-platformer that explores the raw emotions behind toxic relationships. Guided by 100 real phrases shared by people who lived through painful experiences, you\u2019ll control a small, tender character trying to break free from a dark antagonist determined 